OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'sorry' over impact of
OL,4,Aschool bus changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA review of changes to North Yorkshire
OL,7,FCouncil's home-to-school transport
OL,8,Fpolicy, introduced to cut costs, has
OL,9,Fproposed a number of changes.
OL,11,FEligible children starting school since
OL,12,FSeptember 2025 have only had free
OL,13,Ftravel provided to their nearest
OL,14,Fschool, replacing the old system of
OL,15,Fcatchment areas.
OL,17,FThe authority said the policy was
OL,18,F"working really well" but acknowledged
OL,19,Fthere were some "anomalies" uncovered
OL,20,Fby the post-implementation review
OL,21,F(PIR).
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
