OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'sorry' over impact of
OL,4,Aschool bus changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant Chief Executive of the
OL,7,Fcouncil, Rachel Joyce, said they
OL,8,Faccepted some families affected by the
OL,9,Fchanges had "felt like they have had
OL,10,Fnegative experiences" and said they
OL,11,Fwere "sorry about that".
